1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
5 words to never say in sales.

2
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:11,430
[PAIRS - rapid fire]
Don't say buy, instead say invest - because people people invest

3
00:00:11,610 --> 00:00:14,800
in value, not purchases.

4
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:21,460
Don't say contract, instead say agreement - agreements are mutual, contracts feel

5
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,630
one-sided.

6
00:00:23,810 --> 00:00:30,290
Don't say cheap, instead say affordable - affordable feels smart, cheap feels risky.

7
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:36,470
Don't say maybe, instead say absolutely - certainty closes, maybe kills.

8
00:00:36,650 --> 00:00:43,490
Don't say sign, instead say authorize - authorizing feels like a choice, not a trap.

9
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:47,870
Your sales does not have to sound like everyone else's.

10
00:00:48,050 --> 00:00:51,750
Comment 'SYS' and I will send you the full list.

11
00:00:51,930 --> 00:00:55,870
Make sure you follow - it only goes to followers.
